uch. I noted this in the PR description. If you want certainty, a fresh run on the branch would settle it.\n- **PR:** #101, `fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding` \u2192 `main`, reviewer alex. I did not merge it. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}